{"id": "3268361", "name": "הרכבת פונקציות מרובות משתנים - גרסה מעוצבת", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 2, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 18px; text-align: right;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: right;\">נתונות שתי הפונקציות</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 17px; line-height: 2;\">\n<div>\\(F:\\mathbb{R}\\to\\mathbb{R}^2,\\qquad F(t)={{CT:0}}\\)</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 7px;\">\\(g:\\mathbb{R}^2\\to\\mathbb{R},\\qquad g(x,y)={{CT:1}}\\)</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 16px; background: #FFFFFF; text-align: right;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; margin-bottom: 10px; justify-content: flex-start;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background: #EEECEF; color: #4b1f6f; font-weight: bold;\">א</span> <span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">סוגי ההרכבות</span></div>\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0 14px 0; text-align: right;\">קבעו מהו סוג הפונקציה המתקבלת בכל אחת מן ההרכבות.</p>\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px 14px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600;\">\\(F\\circ g\\)</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate;\">[[input:ans1]]\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 6px;\">[[validation:ans1]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px 14px;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600;\">\\(g\\circ F\\)</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate;\">[[input:ans2]]\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 6px;\">[[validation:ans2]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; background: #FFFFFF; text-align: right;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; margin-bottom: 10px; justify-content: flex-start;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background: #EEECEF; color: #4b1f6f; font-weight: bold;\">ב</span> <span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">חישוב ההרכבות</span></div>\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0 10px 0; text-align: right;\">כתבו ביטוי מפורש לכל אחת מן ההרכבות.</p>\n<div style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #665f6b; margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: right;\">כאשר התוצאה היא פונקציה וקטורית, כתבו אותה כווקטור בעזרת סוגריים מרובעות, למשל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\([\\sin(t),\\cos(t)]\\)</span>.</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px 14px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: 17px;\">\\((F\\circ g)(x,y)=\\) [[input:ans3]]</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 12px; padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px solid #EEECEF;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; color: #665f6b; margin-bottom: 5px; text-align: right;\">בדיקת ההקלדה</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center;\">[[validation:ans3]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px 14px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: 17px;\">\\((g\\circ F)(t)=\\) [[input:ans4]]</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 12px; padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px solid #EEECEF;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; color: #665f6b; margin-bottom: 5px; text-align: right;\">בדיקת ההקלדה</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center;\">[[validation:ans4]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right; line-height: 1.75; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 8px;\">פתרון מלא</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0 10px 0;\">נתון <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(F:\\mathbb{R}\\to\\mathbb{R}^2\\)</span> ונתון <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(g:\\mathbb{R}^2\\to\\mathbb{R}\\)</span>.</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0 10px 0;\">לכן בהרכבה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(F\\circ g\\)</span> מתחילים בנקודה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\((x,y)\\in\\mathbb{R}^2\\)</span>, הפונקציה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(g\\)</span> מחזירה מספר ממשי, ואת המספר הזה מציבים בתוך <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(F\\)</span>. מכאן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(F\\circ g:\\mathbb{R}^2\\to\\mathbb{R}^2\\)</span>.</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px; margin: 10px 0;\">\\[ (F\\circ g)(x,y)=F(g(x,y))={{CT:2}} \\]</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 12px 0 10px 0;\">בהרכבה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(g\\circ F\\)</span> מתחילים במספר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(t\\in\\mathbb{R}\\)</span>. הפונקציה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(F\\)</span> מחזירה זוג סדור, ואת שני רכיביו מציבים במקום <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x,y\\)</span> בפונקציה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(g\\)</span>. לכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(g\\circ F:\\mathbb{R}\\to\\mathbb{R}\\)</span>.</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px; margin-top: 10px;\">\\[ (g\\circ F)(t)=g(F(t))={{CT:3}} \\]</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:typefg]] [[feedback:typegf]] [[feedback:compfg]] [[feedback:compgf]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "", "prtpartiallycorrect": "", "prtincorrect": "", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "dropdown", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "dropdown", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 28, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans4", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 28, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "compfg", "value": 0.4, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "exactfg:false;\nif listp(ans3) then exactfg:is(equal(ans3,FFogg));\nswapfgok:false;\nif not listp(ans3) then swapfgok:is(equal(ans3,ggoFF));\nscorefg:if exactfg then 1 elseif swapfgok then 0.375 else 0;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "true", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": "scorefg", "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "compfg-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">[[if test=\"exactfg\"]] ההרכבה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(F\\circ g\\)</span> נכונה. [[elif test=\"swapfgok\"]] <strong>סדר ההרכבה הוחלף.</strong> הביטוי שחישבתם הוא למעשה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(g\\circ F\\)</span>. החישוב עצמו נכון ולכן ניתן ניקוד חלקי. [[else]] ההרכבה אינה נכונה. כדי לחשב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(F(g(x,y))\\)</span>, הציבו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(g(x,y)\\)</span> במקום <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(t\\)</span> בכל אחד משני רכיבי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(F\\)</span>. [[/if]]</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "compfg-F", "feedback": ""}}]}, {"name": "compgf", "value": 0.4, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "exactgf:false;\nif not listp(ans4) then exactgf:is(equal(ans4,ggoFF));\nswapgfok:false;\nif listp(ans4) then swapgfok:is(equal(ans4,FFogg));\nscoregf:if exactgf then 1 elseif swapgfok then 0.375 else 0;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "true", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": "scoregf", "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "compgf-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">[[if test=\"exactgf\"]] ההרכבה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(g\\circ F\\)</span> נכונה. [[elif test=\"swapgfok\"]] <strong>סדר ההרכבה הוחלף.</strong> הביטוי שחישבתם הוא למעשה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(F\\circ g\\)</span>. החישוב עצמו נכון ולכן ניתן ניקוד חלקי. [[else]] ההרכבה אינה נכונה. כדי לחשב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(g(F(t))\\)</span>, הציבו את הרכיב הראשון של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(F(t)\\)</span> במקום <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span> ואת הרכיב השני במקום <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y\\)</span>. [[/if]]</div>"}, "on_false":